《漢廣》","targetNotes":"篇首序文与总疏。","sourceLabel":"第 40 页","sourceNotes":"/tmp/hanguang-pages/chenhuan-1.png 上半页序文。","notes":null,"glosses":[{"key":"0001-1","attributionLabel":"陈奂","sectionLabel":"疏"}]},{"id":"0002","order":2,"total":5,"layer":"span","layerLabel":"诗句片段","targetText":"南有乔木，不可休息。汉有游女，不可求思。汉之广矣，不可泳思。江之永矣，不可方思。","targetNotes":"首章。","sourceLabel":"第 40 页","sourceNotes":"/tmp/hanguang-pages/chenhuan-2.png 上方正文。","notes":null,"glosses":[{"key":"0002-1","attributionLabel":"陈奂","sectionLabel":"疏"}]},{"id":"0003","order":3,"total":5,"layer":"span","layerLabel":"诗句片段","targetText":"翘翘错薪，言刈其楚。之子于归，言秣其马。汉之广矣，不可泳思。江之永矣，不可方思。","targetNotes":"第二章。","sourceLabel":"第 41 页","sourceNotes":"/tmp/hanguang-pages/chenhuan-2.png 下半与 /tmp/hanguang-pages/chenhuan-3.png 上段。","notes":null,"glosses":[{"key":"0003-1","attributionLabel":"陈奂","sectionLabel":"疏"}]},{"id":"0004","order":4,"total":5,"layer":"span","layerLabel":"诗句片段","targetText":"翘翘错薪，言刈其蔞。之子于归，言秣其驹。汉之广矣，不可泳思。江之永矣，不可方思。","targetNotes":"第三章。","sourceLabel":"第 42 页","sourceNotes":"/tmp/hanguang-pages/chenhuan-3.png 下段。","notes":null,"glosses":[{"key":"0004-1","attributionLabel":"陈奂","sectionLabel":"疏"}]},{"id":"0005","order":5,"total":5,"layer":"global","layerLabel":"全篇总说","targetText":"漢廣三章章八句","targetNotes":"章句总说。","sourceLabel":"第 42 页","sourceNotes":"/tmp/hanguang-pages/chenhuan-3.png 末段“章三章章八句”处。","notes":null,"glosses":[{"key":"0005-1","attributionLabel":"陈奂","sectionLabel":"疏"}]}]}}}
